---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
    <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>PI-HUB | Professional Web Solutions</title></head>
    <body class="bg-white text-slate-900 font-sans antialiased">
        <header class="p-8 border-b border-slate-200">
            <nav class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
                <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tighter">PI-HUB</h1>
                <div class="space-x-8 text-sm font-bold text-slate-600">
                    <a href="#services" class="hover:text-blue-600">Services</a>
                    <a href="#contact" class="bg-slate-900 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800">Get Started</a>
                </div>
            </nav>
        </header>

        <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
            <section class="text-center mb-32">
                <h2 class="text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter leading-tight">High-Performance Digital Assets<br/> for Modern Businesses.</h2>
                <p class="text-2xl text-slate-500 mt-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">We architect, design, and manage professional websites that convert visitors into loyal clients. No fluff, just results.</p>
            </section>

            <section id="services" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 mb-32">
                <a href="/niche-web-assets" class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-xl transition">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Niche Web Assets</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">High-conversion sites engineered for specific local trades, consulting firms, and vehicle repair businesses.</p>
                    <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">View Detail →</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/custom-web-design" class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-xl transition">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Custom Web Design</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Bespoke design experiences tailored to your brand identity. Built for speed, security, and impact.</p>
                    <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">View Detail →</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/managed-web-services" class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-xl transition">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Managed Web Services</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Comprehensive oversight of your digital presence. Hosting, security, updates, and performance monitoring.</p>
                    <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">View Detail →</span>
                </a>
            </section>
        </main>
    </body>
</html>
